.TH ANIME-DENOISE 1
.SH NAME
anime-denoise \- native anime-image denoise and upscale CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B anime-denoise
.IR input ...
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Fast ONNX Runtime port of gpt-anime-denoise: ESRGAN/CUGAN/APISR
super-resolution plus L0 smoothing, tiled inference, ICC/EXIF
preservation, PNG/JPEG in and out.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "--method " NAME
esrgan60_l0 (default), esrgan60, cugan60_l0, cugan60, apisr,
l0_0.001, l0_0.0005
.TP
.BI --all
run all 7 methods and write a 4x2 comparison <stem>_sheet.png
.TP
.BI "--l0 " X
L0 strength (default 0.001; 0 skips L0)
.TP
.BI "--down " PCT
pre-downscale percent (default 60; apisr ignores it)
.TP
.BI "--device " auto|gpu|cpu
inference device (default auto; gpu uses CUDA EP when available)
.TP
.BI "--models " DIR
model dir (default $XDG_DATA_HOME/anime-denoise/models)
.TP
.BI "--download " NAME
fetch cugan|apisr weights and exit
.TP
.B --json
one JSON object per completed item on stdout
.TP
.BI "--out " DIR
output directory (default <stem>_denoise/ beside the input)
.TP
.BR --stdin / --stdout
read one image from stdin / write result PNG to stdout
.TP
.BR --quiet ", " -q
no progress output
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib/anime-denoise
binary, runtime/, models/, assets/, cuda-setup.sh
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR anime-denoise-cuda-setup (1)
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/yabo083/cui-anime-denoise
